        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/zalrus9/{size}/2124_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-03T03:06:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p><b>Team Leader Tachyon</b></p><p>HP: 18</p><p>Hand: Lightspeed Barrage (x2), &nbsp;Lightning Reflexes , Hypersonic Assault (x2), &nbsp;Nimble Strike, Fleet of Foot, Hud Goggles, Research Grant</p><p>In Play: &nbsp;HUD Goggles</p><p>Trash: Quick Insight, Supersonic Response, Pushing the Limits (x2), Synaptic Inturruption (x2), Fleet of Foot (x3), Hypersonic Assault, Sucker Punch (x3), Accelerated Assault, Lighning Reflexes, Nimble Strike (x2), Research Grant, Blinding Speed (16 Bursts)</p><p>-----------------</p><p>Start of Hero Turn: nothing</p><p>Play a Card: Play. Lightning Reflexes. Play Accelerated assault (1 to everything). Play Blinding Speed (destroy negative energy field). Play Hypersonic assault (another 1 to everything)</p><p>Use a Power: nope!</p><p>Draw a Card: Hud Goggles</p><p>End of Hero Turn: nothing</p><p>-----------------</p><p>HP: 18</p><p>Hand: Lightspeed Barrage (x2), &nbsp;Lightning Reflexes, Hypersonic Assault (x2), Nimble Strike, Hud Goggles, Accelerated Assualt, Research Grant, Quick Insight, Blinding Speed</p><p>In Play: &nbsp;HUD Goggles, Research Grant</p><p>Trash: Quick Insight, Supersonic Response (x2), Pushing the Limits (x2) , Fleet of Foot(x3), Hypersonic Assault (x2), Synaptic Interuption, Accelerated Assult (x2), Sucker Punch (x3), Synaptic Inturruption (x2) , Lightning Reflexes, Nimble Strike (x2), Blinding Speed (x2). (18 Bursts)</p><p>So... I have 3 cards left in my deck. I gotta Barrage. May need to do it next turn...</p><div>&nbsp;</div>",
