        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-03T04:07:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><strong>NightMist</strong></p><p><strong>HP:</strong> 21</p><p><strong>Hand:</strong>&nbsp; Enlightenment x3, Oblivion, Elder Ring, Starshield Necklace, Planar Banishment x2, Master of Magic, Mistbound x2, Mist Form x2, Tome of Elder Magic, Scouring Mists, Call Forth, Mist-Fueled recovery, Heedless Lash</p><p><strong>&nbsp;In Play:</strong> AotEG, Elder Ring, Master of Magic</p><p><strong>Trash:</strong> Call Forth, Elder Ring, Heedless Lash, Scouring Mists, Planar Banishment, Astral Preminition, Enllightenment, ToEM, Oblivion, Mist-Fueled recovery, AofEG, Mistbound</p><p>-----------------</p><p><strong>Start of Hero Turn: </strong>Nothing</p><p><strong>Play a Card: </strong>Mistbound x2 (Gain 4+1 HP) - Discard...um does it matter? Are we that close to winning? Starshield, Edler Ring, Mist Form, ToEM</p><p><strong>Use a Power:</strong> None</p><p><strong>Draw a Card:</strong> None</p><p><strong>End of Hero Turn:</strong> Nothing</p><p>-----------------</p><p><strong>HP:</strong> 26</p><p><strong>Hand:</strong>&nbsp; Enlightenment x3, Oblivion, Planar Banishment x2, Master of Magic, Mist Form, Scouring Mists, Call Forth, Mist-Fueled recovery, Heedless Lash</p><p><strong>&nbsp;In Play:</strong> AotEG, Elder Ring, Master of Magic</p><p><strong>Deck:</strong> Call Forth, Scouring Mists, Planar Banishment, Astral Preminition, ToEM, Oblivion, Mist-Fueled recovery, AofEG, Starshield Necklace.</p><p>*2* - 1</p><p>*3* - 4</p><p>*4* - 4</p><p><strong>Trash: </strong>Mist of Time x2, Astral Premonition,Oblivion x2, Heedless Lash x2, Call Forth, Scouring Mists, Enlightenment, Elder Ring x2, Mit Form, ToEM, Starshield Necklace</p><p>-----------------</p><p><strong>Notes:</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
