        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-03T04:19:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think we got her next round. If Tachyon can deal 36&nbsp;ith both Light-Speed Barrages.&nbsp;Haka can get about 27, 31 if Haka be bounce the second Taiha hit off of NightMist. And Tempest Has a Gene-Bound plus a Into the Stratosphere even though it won't knock anything back it will still deal 4, plus 3 for squall. So 7 damage from that. Plus NightMist can play an Oblivion that will do at least 7, plus redirecting the damage , probably chosing the highest to deal all hero target so that will be an addition 4 damage to Akash. So that brings it up to 11, plus a Heedless Lash will at least do 3. Bringing the total NightMist can do to 14, if Heeless Lash. So that is 88 points of damage... That's 1 point more than what she has! So were pretty much in the clear as to what is going to happen next round... Do we really want to go through it all or just go ahead and call it?</p>",
